    <briefdescription>
<para>Routing decision produced by a routing strategy. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Specifies where and how tensor-layer results should be forwarded:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>To graph validation for truth layer processing</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>To fallback/degraded path if primary failed</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>To caching/memoization for similar future queries </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
